.TH GTTY-CLI 1 "November 2026" "gtty 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gtty-cli \- command-line RTTY encoder, decoder and audio tools for gtty
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gtty-cli
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI encode " TEXT out.wav"
Generate an AFSK RTTY WAV file.
.TP
.BI decode " in.wav"
Decode a recording with both demodulators.
.TP
.B listen
Decode live audio to standard output.
.TP
.BI record " out.wav"
Capture live audio to a WAV file (see
.BR \-\-seconds ).
.TP
.B devices
List audio devices.
.TP
.BR rigs " [" filter ]
List Hamlib rig models.
.TP
.B rig
Read frequency and mode from a rig
.RB ( \-\-model ", " \-\-device ", " \-\-serial\-baud ", " \-\-debug ).
.SH OPTIONS
.BR \-\-baud ", " \-\-shift ", " \-\-mark ", " \-\-reverse ", " \-\-rate ", " \-\-no\-afc ", " \-\-no\-atc ", " \-\-ustty ", " \-\-in ", " \-\-out ", " \-\-seconds .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gtty (1)
